OL,3,GNEWSA'World class' waterfront          
OL,4,Aredevelopment plan approved            
OL,6,FPlans to redevelop 60 hectares (148    
OL,7,Facres) of Liverpool's historic northern
OL,8,Fwaterfront have been approved by the   
OL,9,Fcity's council.                        
OL,11,FDevelopers Peel Waters first submitted 
OL,12,Fplans for the area in 2013 and these   
OL,13,Fhave been updated in light of the      
OL,14,Fconstruction of Everton's new home     
OL,15,Fsince August 2025, the Hill Dickinson  
OL,16,FStadium.                               
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
