OL,3,GNEWSA'World class' waterfront          
OL,4,Aredevelopment plan approved            
OL,6,FPeel Waters say up to 5,836 homes - 20%
OL,7,Fof which will be classed as            
OL,8,F"affordable" - will be built, along    
OL,9,Fwith "sustainable infrastructure" and a
OL,10,Ffive-acre waterfront park which is set 
OL,11,Fto open in the spring of 2028.         
OL,13,FIt will be the latest area to be       
OL,14,Fredeveloped under the 30-year #5bn     
OL,15,FLiverpool Waters scheme.               
